json5/object
description: Comma-separated list of key-value pairs, enclosed into curly braces; a trailing comma is allowed
- >
  A JSON5 object is a
  [json/object](*::language:concretes:07-json_code:00-json_structured:00-json_object) with two
  sugars - the key need not be double-quoted, and a trailing comma after the last pair is allowed:
- !!<format: text/x-json5> |
  {name: 'Julia', age: 42,}
- >
  The pair is a construct of its own - see the subchapter below:
- *: 00-json5_key_value_pair
- *..:..:..:07-json_code:00-json_structured:00-json_object
